{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212300","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212300","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621230001:0":{"text":"ハーメルさん……さっきの人たちが言ってた「最終期限」って、どういう意味ですか？","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生，刚才那些人说的“最后期限”……是什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4893D5E38D0E1557","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621230002:0":{"text":"それは……ただの取り立てだよ。協会の補助金がもうすぐ入るし、君たちが気にすることないよ。","source_cn":"那些人……不过是一群来收租的而已，协会的补助还在路上，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x219C2B66774244A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621230003:0":{"text":"こういう片隅で細々やってる小さな組織は、嵐が来る前に屋根を打ち付けておくのが常なんだ。","source_cn":"像我们这种角落里的小组织，向来要在风雨来临前，先把屋顶钉牢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AC5DFCDF80A21A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1621230003":{"text":"こういう片隅で細々やってる小さな組織は、嵐が来る前に屋根を打ち付けておくのが常なんだ。","source_cn":"像我们这种角落里的小组织，向来要在风雨来临前，先把屋顶钉牢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2AC5DFCDF80A21A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621230004:0":{"text":"君たち……この鉄の塊を持ち帰ってきたの？しかも手で？","source_cn":"你们……将这些铁制的实心家伙带回来了，光用手搬的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x442D4BA92E95FD2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621230005:1":{"text":"それは大したことではないんですが……この罠、魔法の痕跡があるんです。おそらく普通の人が仕掛けたものではありません。","source_cn":"对我们来说不算难，不过……这些陷阱上有魔法痕迹，似乎不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x889A1A7F2CA75ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621230006:1":{"text":"ハーメルさん、心当たりはありませんか？","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生，你知道是谁干的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AE95ABC416FE07C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621230007:1":{"text":"それも、まだ試用段階の君たちが気にすることじゃない。僕のほうで対処しておくよ。","source_cn":"这事啊……现在还不该由你们去操心，我会处理好的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8CA58D664DF654D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1621230007":{"text":"それも、まだ試用段階の君たちが気にすることじゃない。僕のほうで対処しておくよ。","source_cn":"这事啊……现在还不该由你们去操心，我会处理好的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8CA58D664DF654D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621230008:1":{"text":"ふっ……君たちはまるで、初春の雪夜に踏み入ってきた旅人のようだ。光を携え、温もりまで運んでくれる。","source_cn":"呵，你们啊……真像是初春闯进雪夜的旅人，带着光，也带着热。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43A3FC3948E96690","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621230009:1":{"text":"でも覚えていてほしい。誰かがそばにいても、すべての風雪を防げるとは限らないんだ。","source_cn":"不过别忘了，就算有人陪着，也未必能抵挡所有风雪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x585F2B45A52DFBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621230010:1":{"text":"ありがとう……気持ちだけ受け取っておくよ。","source_cn":"但……谢谢你们，真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D0F447B7F2F30C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621230015:1":{"text":"とにかく、よくやってくれたね。次のテストについてはまたあとで伝える。","source_cn":"你们做得很好，下一阶段的考验，我晚点告诉你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB127126C659BA363","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621230016:0":{"text":"僕はまだ私用があるから、先に失礼するよ。","source_cn":"我还有些私事要处理，先走一步。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5BCADE349B58E6E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621230017:1":{"text":"そう言い残し、まるで避けられぬ用事へ向かうように、その場を足早に立ち去った。","source_cn":"说完，哈梅尔像赶赴一场旧约定似的，匆匆离开了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BB6C8887B1B0FDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_